{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_35c1086f7984478f9d3976eac4294ddf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4c6a0c1bea34b440959609435f47c8abed84054eabd139cfcc40a67b541406a8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"atomgit-atomcode/atomcode@287bff70f940 snapshot 21b0b17abcf968f4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_002b753676064077b6c4e979d35eb124713d93817a225e8c2f034a06c0027a5b","slc_563697598b29645fc466c8bb1148c53b93c361722099ba4135b4f40a59b758bd","slc_5ee03e5fc77e7aaeac116c9ce429a825d6a086195c6ec3032a73f71dea0f6030","slc_c7ea481eb26ab6e9d42bec40a646d4fea804d75c8f2a00656f6177cc91221747"],"source_ids":["src_3fe97386ba0f5755ac042e1a14e827ec"],"text":"Configuration lives at ~/.atomcode/config.toml with provider entries (type, api_key, model, base_url, context_window); /reload picks up manual edits without restart, and a first-run wizard guides provider setup.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35c1086f7984478f9d3976eac4294ddf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_35c1086f7984478f9d3976eac4294ddf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_54c6366498d4def7fc5f511f2a3b68c42018d63c87ebbe846a2c0a6c00ba7447","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"atomgit-atomcode/atomcode@287bff70f940 snapshot 21b0b17abcf968f4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1f6932a445582a26351265004f74b511def4d68e1bbb1fb7280d8d2674fc55d9","slc_c99aeed6ff7b86606f40f6d54f99b3da46bf0ad1c16c21796cac13249b6d2008"],"source_ids":["src_3fe97386ba0f5755ac042e1a14e827ec"],"text":"The agent supports multiple LLM providers via OpenAI function-calling, including Claude, OpenAI, DeepSeek, Zhipu GLM, Qwen, SiliconFlow, Ollama (partial), and any OpenAI-compatible API.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35c1086f7984478f9d3976eac4294ddf"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_35c1086f7984478f9d3976eac4294ddf","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5fc56691298269bc57cecbf43633e8f69fcf3e71c305c46b4d22e528a66b86e5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"atomgit-atomcode/atomcode@287bff70f940 snapshot 21b0b17abcf968f4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fe07302803ff19d04cd39060c9e8f699a1a9fb32c1bd1c2aecc775ceda8c5205"],"source_ids":["src_3fe97386ba0f5755ac042e1a14e827ec"],"text":"The CLI offers persistent sessions (--continue, /resume), AtomGit OAuth login, SSO login, headless single-prompt mode, and a daemon exposing an HTTP API with SSE streaming chat.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35c1086f7984478f9d3976eac4294ddf"}
